	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Audio (reverende pater) vos istic rebus novis ad naus<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>eam usque abundare; nos miseri nihil plane habemus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mercatores <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nostri, qui magna apud vos copia et frequentissimi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>fuerunt, omnes redierunt praeter unum <persName ref="p8114">Balingketum</persName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>postridie huius diei primum expectatur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De rebus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et <placeName ref="l822">Germanicis</placeName> ad me ne verbum quidem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Nunc maxime percuperem rescire ecclesię statum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Cras <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>hic erunt nuptiae: episcopus sororem illa suam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>locavit ei, qui custos fuit collegii, dem custor, dem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName>Schouwenstein</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Das canonicat söllend sy einem jungen <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>knaben zuͦgestelt han, sol by h[errn] <persName ref="p20480">Rhuͦdolff Funcken</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>am tisch syn.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ita ipsi ludunt cum sua religione.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Sind so vyl armer lüt, denen der tod uß den ougen <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sicht, und mag yederman zuͦluͦgen, das die also <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mit dem kilchenguͦtt umbgaand.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed frustra <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>haec conqueror etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> noster <placeName ref="l93">Clavennensis</placeName> adeo vicinus fuit morti, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ut semel iterumque consulibus mors eius nunciata esset, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quod nuncium me non parum perculerat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nunc <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>audio illum convalescere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quaeso, communica nova, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quae ei impertiam quibusque nonnihil aegrum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>animum refocillem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Orationem meam, quod socero meo sic videretur <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>egoque ab eius sententia certas ob causas non multum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>abhorrerem, sub nomine meo apparere volui.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Scio, quod antichristianorum furorem in me <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>concitarim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed furiant quantumvis; ideo, ut <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>illis ilia commoverem, hoc, quicquid est, scripsi.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p8126">Oporinus</persName> excudit; exemplaria nondum sunt <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>allata; cum fuerint allata, ab affine <persName ref="p4554">Collino</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>accipies.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Audio interim concilium perpetuari et abbati <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName>Eremi</persName> non nisi valetudinis recuperandae <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>gratia missionem concessam fuisse nec <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>permissum, ut longius iret praeterquam ad hoc <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>monasterium in <placeName>Algavia</placeName>, in quo decumbit etc.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Diligentissime inquiro in illas sessiones; sed nihil<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>dum perficio; sed tamen non desinam inquirere amplius.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Scribam denuo ad d. <persName ref="p6831">Traversum</persName> et d. <persName>Iulium</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>mandabo d. <persName ref="p8114">Balinggeto</persName>, <persName ref="p8093">Herculem</persName> urgebo; si nihil <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>hinc extorqueo, nescio, quid amplius facere possim.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Quid modo perscribatur, ex hac schedula apposita intelliges.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater, cum tuis omnibus quam diutissime et felicissime.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 7. septembri<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>s anno 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tui observans <persName ref="p8009">F[abricius]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecc<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>lesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti vigilantissimo et dignis<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>simo, domino suo semper honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
